#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionextracttext.cpp:112
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"extracttext\" action may be used within the context of a \"foreverypart"
"\" loop and is used to store text into a variable"
msgstr "Radnja „extracttext” može se koristiti unutar petlje „foreverypart” za pohranu teksta u varijablu."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionfileinto.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "File Into"
msgstr "Spremi u mapu"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionfileinto.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Action \"fileinto\" has \"copy\" argument but current server does not "
"support it"
msgstr "Radnja „fileinto” sadrži argument „copy”, ali ga trenutačni poslužitelj ne podržava"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionfileinto.cpp:98
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionredirect.cpp:36
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Keep a copy"
msgstr "Zadrži kopiju"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionfileinto.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Create folder"
msgstr "Stvori mapu"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionfileinto.cpp:149
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"fileinto\" action delivers the message into the specified mailbox."
msgstr "Radnja „fileinto” isporučuje poruku u navedeni poštanski sandučić."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionfileinto.cpp:152
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the optional \":create\" argument is specified, it instructs the Sieve "
"interpreter to create the specified mailbox, if needed, before attempting to "
"deliver the message into the specified mailbox."
msgstr "Ako je naveden neobavezni argument „:create”, tumaču Sievea nalaže se da po potrebi stvori navedeni poštanski sandučić prije pokušaja isporuke poruke u njega."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionfileinto.cpp:157
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the optional \":copy\" keyword is specified, the tagged command does not "
"cancel the implicit \"keep\". Instead, it merely files or redirects a copy "
"in addition to whatever else is happening to the message."
msgstr "Ako je navedena neobavezna ključna riječ „:copy”, označena naredba ne poništava implicitno zadržavanje („keep”), već dodatno sprema ili preusmjerava kopiju poruke."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionkeep.cpp:45
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"keep\" action is whatever action is taken in lieu of all other "
"actions, if no filtering happens at all; generally, this simply means to "
"file the message into the user's main mailbox."
msgstr "Radnja „keep” podrazumijeva da se, ako se ne primijeni nijedno filtriranje, umjesto svih drugih radnji zadrži poruka; obično se ona sprema u korisnikov glavni poštanski sandučić."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionkeep.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Add flags:"
msgstr "Dodaj oznake:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionnotify.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Notify"
msgstr "Obavijesti"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionnotify.cpp:41
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "message:"
msgstr "poruka:"

