#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "method:"
msgstr "način:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionnotify.cpp:134
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"notify\" action specifies that a notification should be sent to a user."
msgstr "Radnja „notify” određuje da se korisniku pošalje obavijest."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionredirect.cpp:23
#, kde-format
msgid "Redirect"
msgstr "Preusmjeri"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionredirect.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Use list"
msgstr "Koristi popis"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionredirect.cpp:140
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"redirect\" action is used to send the message to another user at a "
"supplied address, as a mail forwarding feature does.  The \"redirect\" "
"action makes no changes to the message body or existing headers, but it may "
"add new headers."
msgstr "Radnja „redirect” koristi se za slanje poruke drugom korisniku na navedenu adresu, kao kod prosljeđivanja pošte. Ne mijenja tijelo poruke ni postojeća zaglavlja, ali može dodati nova zaglavlja."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionredirect.cpp:144
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the optional \":copy\" keyword is specified, the tagged command does not "
"cancel the implicit \"keep\". Instead, it redirects a copy in addition to "
"whatever else is happening to the message."
msgstr "Ako je navedena neobavezna ključna riječ „:copy”, označena naredba ne poništava implicitno zadržavanje („keep”), već preusmjerava kopiju uz sve ostale radnje koje se provode nad porukom."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionreject.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Reject"
msgstr "Odbij"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionreject.cpp:88
#, kde-format
msgid ""
" The \"reject\" action cancels the implicit keep and refuses delivery of a "
"message."
msgstr "Radnja „reject” poništava implicitno zadržavanje i odbija isporuku poruke."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionremoveflags.cpp:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove Flags"
msgstr "Ukloni oznake"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionremoveflags.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Removeflag is used to remove flags from a list of [IMAP] flags. Removeflag "
"clears flags previously set by \"set\"/\"addflag\". Calling removeflag with "
"a flag that wasn't set before is not an error and is ignored."
msgstr "Removeflag se koristi za uklanjanje oznaka s popisa oznaka [IMAP]. Briše oznake koje su prethodno postavljene naredbom „set” ili „addflag”. Poziv removeflag s oznakom koja nije bila postavljena nije pogreška i zanemaruje se."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionreplace.cpp:26
#, kde-format
msgid "Replace"
msgstr "Zamijeni"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionreplace.cpp:46
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "from:"
msgstr "iz:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionreplace.cpp:144
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"replace\" command is defined to allow a MIME part to be replaced with "
"the text supplied in the command."
msgstr "Naredba „replace” omogućuje zamjenu MIME dijela tekstom navedenim u naredbi."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionreturn.cpp:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Return"
msgstr "Vrati"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionreturn.cpp:32
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"return\" command stops processing of the immediately included script "
"only and returns processing control to the script that includes it."
msgstr "Naredba „return” zaustavlja obradu samo neposredno uključene skripte i vraća kontrolu obrade skripti koja ju je uključila."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionsetflags.cpp:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Set Flags"
msgstr "Postavi oznake"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionsetflags.cpp:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Setflag is used for setting [IMAP] system flags or keywords. Setflag "
"replaces any previously set flags."
msgstr "Setflag se koristi za postavljanje sistemskih oznaka ili ključnih riječi [IMAP]. Zamjenjuje prethodno postavljene oznake."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionsetvariable.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Varijabla"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionsetvariable.cpp:43
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Protect special character"
msgstr "Zaštiti posebne znakove"

