msgid "day:"
msgstr "dan:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionvacation.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Message subject:"
msgstr "Predmet poruke:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionvacation.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Additional email:"
msgstr "Dodatna adresa e-pošte:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionvacation.cpp:76
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Vacation reason:"
msgstr "Razlog odsutnosti:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionvacation.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"vacation\" action implements a vacation autoresponder similar to the "
"vacation command available under many versions of Unix. Its purpose is to "
"provide correspondents with notification that the user is away for an "
"extended period of time and that they should not expect quick responses."
msgstr "Radnja „vacation” implementira automatski odgovor o odsutnosti, sličan naredbi vacation dostupnoj u mnogim inačicama Unixa. Svrha joj je obavijestiti dopisnike da je korisnik dulje vrijeme odsutan i da ne trebaju očekivati brze odgovore."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionvacation.cpp:201
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Through the \":days\" parameter, it limits the number of auto-replies to the "
"same sender to one per [n] days, for a specified number of days. But there "
"are cases when one needs more granularity, if one would like to generate "
"\"vacation\" replies more frequently."
msgstr "Parametrom „:days” broj automatskih odgovora istom pošiljatelju ograničava se na jedan tijekom navedenog broja dana. No ponekad je potrebna veća preciznost kako bi se odgovori o odsutnosti slali češće."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionvacation.cpp:203
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This extension defines a \":seconds\" parameter to provide more granularity "
"for such situations."
msgstr "Ovo proširenje definira parametar „:seconds” za preciznije podešavanje takvih situacija."

