#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionaddress.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adresa"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionaddress.cpp:56
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionenvelope.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "address:"
msgstr "adresa:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionaddress.cpp:63
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionenvelope.cpp:66
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid "Use ; to separate emails"
msgstr "Za razdvajanje adresa e-pošte koristite ;"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionaddress.cpp:98
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"address\" test matches Internet addresses in structured headers that "
"contain addresses.  It returns true if any header contains any key in the "
"specified part of the address, as modified by the comparator and the match "
"keyword."
msgstr "Test „address” podudara internetske adrese u strukturiranim zaglavljima koja sadrže adrese. Vraća istinito ako bilo koje zaglavlje sadrži ključ u navedenom dijelu adrese, uz primjenu usporednika i ključne riječi za podudaranje."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionbody.cpp:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Body"
msgstr "Tijelo"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionbody.cpp:89
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The body test matches content in the body of an email message, that is, "
"anything following the first empty line after the header.  (The empty line "
"itself, if present, is not considered to be part of the body.)"
msgstr "Test tijela podudara sadržaj u tijelu poruke e-pošte, odnosno sve što slijedi nakon prvog praznog retka iza zaglavlja. (Sam prazan redak, ako postoji, ne smatra se dijelom tijela.)"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditioncurrentdate.cpp:23
#, kde-format
msgid "Currentdate"
msgstr "Trenutačni datum"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditioncurrentdate.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The currentdate test is similar to the date test, except that it operates on "
"the current date/time rather than a value extracted from the message header."
msgstr "Test „currentdate” sličan je testu „date”, no koristi trenutačni datum i vrijeme umjesto vrijednosti izdvojene iz zaglavlja poruke."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditiondate.cpp:27
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/widgets/selectdatewidget.cpp:43
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/widgets/selectheadertypecombobox.cpp:238
#, kde-format
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Datum"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditiondate.cpp:97
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The date test matches date/time information derived from headers containing "
"date-time values."
msgstr "Test „date” podudara podatke o datumu i vremenu izvedene iz zaglavlja koja sadrže vrijednosti datuma i vremena."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionenvelope.cpp:28
#, kde-format
msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "Omotnica"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionenvelope.cpp:109
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"envelope\" test is true if the specified part of the [SMTP] (or "
"equivalent) envelope matches the specified key."
msgstr "Test „envelope” vraća istinito ako se navedeni dio omotnice [SMTP] (ili ekvivalentne omotnice) podudara s navedenim ključem."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionenvironment.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Okruženje"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionenvironment.cpp:35
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Item:"
msgstr "Stavka:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionenvironment.cpp:92
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The environment test retrieves the item of environment information specified "
"by the name string and matches it to the values specified in the key-list "
"argument."
msgstr "Test okruženja dohvaća stavku podataka o okruženju navedenu nizom naziva i uspoređuje je s vrijednostima navedenima u argumentu popisa ključeva."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionexists.cpp:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Exists"
msgstr "Postoji"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionexists.cpp:37
#, kde-format
msgid "exists"
msgstr "postoji"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionexists.cpp:38
#, kde-format
msgid "not exists"
msgstr "ne postoji"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionexists.cpp:65
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"exists\" test is true if the headers listed in the header-names "
"argument exist within the message.  All of the headers must exist or the "
"test is false."
msgstr "Test „exists” vraća istinito ako zaglavlja navedena u argumentu header-names postoje u poruci. Sva zaglavlja moraju postojati, inače je rezultat testa neistinit."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionfalse.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "False"
msgstr "Neistinito"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionfalse.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "false"
msgstr "neistinito"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionfalse.cpp:45
#, kde-format
msgid "The \"false\" test always evaluates to false."
msgstr "Test \"false\" uvijek daje rezultat false."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionhasflag.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Has Flag"
msgstr "Ima oznaku"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionhasflag.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid ""
"Variable name\n"
" (if empty it uses internal variable):"
msgstr ""
"Naziv varijable\n"
" (ako je prazno, koristi se interna varijabla):"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionhasflag.cpp:130
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The hasflag test evaluates to true if any of the variables matches any flag "
"name."
msgstr "Test hasflag daje rezultat true ako se neka od varijabli podudara s bilo "
"kojim nazivom oznake."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionheader.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Zaglavlje"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionheader.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "With value:"
msgstr "S vrijednošću:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionheader.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"header\" test evaluates to true if the value of any of the named "
"headers, ignoring leading and trailing whitespace, matches any key."
msgstr "Test \"header\" daje rezultat true ako se vrijednost bilo kojeg "
"navedenog zaglavlja, zanemarujući početne i završne bjeline, podudara s "
"nekim ključem."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionihave.cpp:23
#, kde-format
msgid "IHave"
msgstr "IHave"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionihave.cpp:37
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid "Use \",\" to separate capabilities"
msgstr "Za razdvajanje mogućnosti koristite „,”"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionihave.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"ihave\" test provides a means for Sieve scripts to test for the "
"existence of a given extension prior to actually using it."
msgstr "Test \"ihave\" omogućuje skriptama Sieve da provjere postoji li "
"određeno proširenje prije nego što ga upotrijebe."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmailboxexists.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Mailbox exists"
msgstr "Poštanski sandučić postoji"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmailboxexists.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"mailboxexists\" test is true if all mailboxes listed in the \"mailbox-"
"names\" argument exist in the mailstore, and each allows the user in whose "
"context the Sieve script runs to \"deliver\" messages into it."
msgstr "Test \"mailboxexists\" daje rezultat true ako sve mape navedene u "
"argumentu \"mailbox-names\" postoje u spremištu pošte i svaka dopušta "
"korisniku u čijem se kontekstu izvodi skripta Sieve da u nju \"isporučuje\" "
"poruke."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadata.cpp:28
#, kde-format
msgid "Meta Data"
msgstr "Metapodaci"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadata.cpp:48
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadataexists.cpp:35
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionservermetadata.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Mailbox:"
msgstr "Poštanski sandučić:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadata.cpp:58
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionservermetadata.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Annotations:"
msgstr "Zabilješke:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadata.cpp:123
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This test retrieves the value of the mailbox annotation \"annotation-name\" "
"for the mailbox \"mailbox\". The retrieved value is compared to the \"key-"
"list\". The test returns true if the annotation exists and its value matches "
"any of the keys."
msgstr "Ovaj test dohvaća vrijednost napomene mape \"annotation-name\" za "
"mapu \"mailbox\". Dohvaćena se vrijednost uspoređuje s popisom \"key-list\". "
"Test daje rezultat true ako napomena postoji i njezina se vrijednost "
"podudara s nekim od ključeva."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadataexists.cpp:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Metadata exists"
msgstr "Metapodaci postoje"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadataexists.cpp:44
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionservermetadataexists.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Annotation:"
msgstr "Zabilješka:"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionmetadataexists.cpp:83
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"metadataexists\" test is true if all of the annotations listed in the "
"\"annotation-names\" argument exist for the specified mailbox."
msgstr "Test \"metadataexists\" daje rezultat true ako postoje sve napomene "
"navedene u argumentu \"annotation-names\" za zadanu mapu."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionservermetadata.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Server Meta Data"
msgstr "Metapodaci poslužitelja"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionservermetadata.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This test retrieves the value of the server annotation \"annotation-name\".  "
"The retrieved value is compared to the \"key-list\". The test returns true "
"if the annotation exists and its value matches any of the keys."
msgstr "Ovaj test dohvaća vrijednost napomene poslužitelja \"annotation-name\". "
"Dohvaćena se vrijednost uspoređuje s popisom \"key-list\". Test daje "
"rezultat true ako napomena postoji i njezina se vrijednost podudara s nekim "
"od ključeva."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionservermetadataexists.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Server Meta Data Exists"
msgstr "Metapodaci poslužitelja postoje"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionservermetadataexists.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"servermetadataexists\" test is true if all of the server annotations "
"listed in the \"annotation-names\" argument exist."
msgstr "Test \"servermetadataexists\" daje rezultat true ako postoje sve "
"napomene poslužitelja navedene u argumentu \"annotation-names\"."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionsize.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Veličina"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionsize.cpp:35
#, kde-format
msgid "under"
msgstr "manje od"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionsize.cpp:36
#, kde-format
msgid "over"
msgstr "više od"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionsize.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The \"size\" test deals with the size of a message.  It takes either a "
"tagged argument of \":over\" or \":under\", followed by a number "
"representing the size of the message."
msgstr "Test \"size\" odnosi se na veličinu poruke. Uzima označeni argument "
"\":over\" ili \":under\", nakon kojeg slijedi broj koji predstavlja veličinu "
"poruke."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionspamtest.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Spam Test"
msgstr "Test neželjene pošte"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionspamtest.cpp:38
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "Postotak"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionspamtest.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sieve implementations that implement the \"spamtest\" test use an identifier "
"of either \"spamtest\" or \"spamtestplus\" for use with the capability "
"mechanism."
msgstr "Implementacije Sievea koje podržavaju test \"spamtest\" koriste "
"identifikator \"spamtest\" ili \"spamtestplus\" za mehanizam mogućnosti."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditiontrue.cpp:22
#, kde-format
msgid "True"
msgstr "Istinito"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditiontrue.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "true"
msgstr "istinito"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditiontrue.cpp:45
#, kde-format
msgid "The \"true\" test always evaluates to true."
msgstr "Test \"true\" uvijek daje rezultat true."

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionvirustest.cpp:24
#, kde-format
msgid "Virus Test"
msgstr "Test virusa"

#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveconditions/sieveconditionvirustest.cpp:92
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sieve implementations that implement the \"virustest\" test have an "
"identifier of \"virustest\" for use with the capability mechanism."
msgstr "Implementacije Sievea koje podržavaju test \"virustest\" koriste "
"identifikator \"virustest\" za mehanizam mogućnosti."

